DOCUMENT(); loadMacros("PGstandard.pl","MathObjects.pl","PGML.pl"); TEXT(beginproblem());
Context("Numeric");
$C = Compute("sqrt(89)");
$phi = Compute("atan2(8,5)");  # if missing in your WW, replace with atan(8/5)
BEGIN_PGML
**Problem 10.** Skriv \(5\sin x + 8\cos x\) som \(C\sin(x+\varphi)\) där \(C\ge 0\) och \(-\pi \le \varphi \le \pi\).

\(C=\) [_]{$C}  
\(\varphi=\) [_]{$phi}
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
